# REEFER storefront — production build config.
#
# Backend: ASH AI API (ash-ai-backend), Bearer-token auth.
#
# Version-FREE on purpose. This app now talks to two different API generations on the
# same host: auth is on /v2 (login/reefer, register/reefer, verify-otp, logout, me) and
# the catalogue is still on /v1. Each service module in src/api/ carries its own version
# prefix, so pinning one here would break the other.
#
#   src/api/authApi.js     -> /v2/...   (live on ash-ai-backend)
#   src/api/productApi.js  -> /v1/...   (NOT yet ported to ash-ai-backend — see below)
#
# Vite inlines VITE_* at BUILD time. Changing this needs a rebuild, not a restart.
VITE_API_URL=https://api.sorbetesapparel.com/api
